<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id">Ruth</book>
  <para style="h">Ruth</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ruth</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ruth</para>
  <para style="mt">Ruth</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachia thukhen vaihawmten vai ahawm laiun, hichi ahi a, gam sungah kiel ahing tunga. Tualeh Bethlehem a Juda mi khat Moab gam a um dingin ama leh azi leh atapate ni toh apeita ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khum mipa min Elimelek ahia, azi min Naomi ahi, tualeh atapate gel min Mahlon leh Kilon, Bethlehem-Juda Ephrath mi ahi uhi. Tualeh Moab gam ah ahing pei ua, khunah a umdenta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n, Naomi pasal Elimelek ashi a, amanu leh atapate ni maimai a umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh amaun Moab numeite zi in anei ua, khat nu min Orpah ahia, adang khat nu min pen Ruth ahi. Tualeh khunah kum sawm ding vel ateng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mahlon leh Kilon zong ani un ahing shita ua, tuachi’n numeinu khu atate nileh a pasal in ashi santa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu amoute gel toh Moab gam akipat nua pei kia dingin akisata ua, Mangpa’n amite neh ding pie a ave dan thu Moab gam a kipat a na zah zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin a umna akipat in amoute geltoh apawt ua, Juda gam a nua pei kia dingin apeita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Naomi in amoute gel kungah, “Pei unlen na nute uh inn tuoh ah nuapei kiata un; Mangpa’n mi shi tung leh ka tunga na bawl bangun na tung uah siemtah in hing bawlta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangpa’n na ni un pasal dang na neinate uh innsung tuoh ah khawl damna namu theina dingun hing hepita hen,” achi hi. Tuachi’n amautegel atawp a, tuachi’n aw ngaitahin akapta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh amaun, “Pei sih va ung, na mite kunga napei peina ah ka hing pei ding uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Naomi in, “Ka tanute aw, pei kia zaw un; bang zieh a ka kunga hing pei mama ding nahi uoi mah? Na pasal dinguh tapa ka pai kia thei na ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka tanute aw kisa unlen pei un; pasal nei dingin ka teh sengta hi. Ki nepna ka nei nalai chiin tuzan mama in pasal nei vangin tapate ka nei ding chinan leng zong;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A pichin tan uh na ngah na ding u’amah? Pasal neilou in na umden ding uh amah? Hitalawmlou e ka tanute aw; nou ziehin ka lungkham sengseng hi, Mangpa’n kei douna’n akhut ka tungah atu sahta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n, aw ngaitah suo in akap kiata uhi; tuachi’n Orpah in api atawpa, hinanleh Ruth in pen api atu chinten hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh amanu’n “En in, na moupinu, amite leh a pasiente kung lam ah anua pei kiata hi, nang zong na moupinu del inlen nua pei kia maita in” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh Ruth in, “Nang nuasie ding leh nang zuilou a nua pei kia dingin hing zawl teitei sin; napei peina ah ka pei dinga, na gieh giehna ah ka gieh dinga; na mite ka mite ahi dinga, tualeh na Pasian, ka Pasian ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na shina ah ka shi dinga, khunah ka kivui ding hi; nang leh kei shina loungal sildangin a hing khen ding leh Mangpa’n alawlaw hing law mai henlen, tua sanga thupi zawin zong hing bawl ta heh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman akungah pei atum chinten hi chi atheitahin, bangma a gen nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n ani un Bethlehem tan apei khawmta uhi, tualeh hichi ahi a, Bethlehem ahing tun un, akho pumpi amaute gel zieh in achizata ua, numeiten “Tamnu Naomi hi lou i?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman akung uah, “Naomi hing chisih unlen Marah hing chi zaw un, Bangkimbawltheipa’n ka tungah hasiet huoitahin a hing bawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Buchingtahin ka pawtdoh a, Mangpa’n khut guohin ahing nua pui kiata hi: Mangpa’n ka tungah alungkimlouna alang sahta hi, Bangkimbawltheipa’n ahing suh genthei dan thei gehguh a, Bangdinga Naomi, nangchi nalai uh ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Naomi ahing kinuale kiata a, amounu Moab numei Ruth toh Moab gam a kipat in ahing nua pei kiata uhi; tualeh barli bu at pat hun lai in Bethlehem ahing tung uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Naomi in apasal sanggam kinaipi Elimelek innkuonpite lah a mi hausatah khat anei a; amin Boaz ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Moab numei Ruth in Naomi kungah, “Lou lam ah va kuon vangin, lou a mi ahing hepi pouma kungah, bu sang vasui vang aw,” achia, tualeh Naomi in, “Va kuon ve ka tanu” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu akuonta a, lou Lai a bu lamite lahmanghil bu sangte ava sui a; Tuachi’n Elimelek innkuonpipa Boaz lou ah ava kuon khata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ngai vawi, Boaz khu Bethlehem akipat in alou ah ava haw a, bu lamite kungah, “Mangpa noute toh umkhawmta hen,” achia, tualeh amaun “Mangpa’n hing guolzawlta hen” chiin adawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Boaz in asuoh bu lamite lamkaipa kungah, “Tami nu heilam nungah ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh asuoh abu atmite tunga lamkaipa’n, Moab nungah, “Moab gam a kipata Naomi toh hing peikhawm ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu’n Hing hepi inlen, na busang uh sui vangin, bu atmiten abu phai uh alahkhawm zou chiengun suizel vang aw achia; tuachi’n ahing pei a, inn a tomnou khat ava um chilou, zingmawng akipat tutan khawllou in asem hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Boaz in Ruth kungah, “Ngaiin ka tanu; bu sang suiin lou dangah kuon sinlen, tana kipat in peidoh sinlen, ka suoh nungahte kungah um khinkhian in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A bu at uh en ngitnget inlen, anua uh suizel in; tangvalte nang bangma hing lawlou dingin thu ka pe zouta hi. Tualeh na dangta pouma chiengin tuibel a tangvalte tui tawisa vadawn zel in” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu amai tuolsu in akhupboha, akungah “Gamtuom mi lah ka hi ngal a, hichibanga na hing thei nuom a, na hing lungsiet bang chidan ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Boaz in adawnga akungah, “Na pasal shi nua akipat na pinu tunga nasil bawl zousie kimtah in ahing kihil sieng keei a, tualeh nanu leh napa leh na pienna gam nuasie a, nidanga na thei ngailou mite kunga na hing peidan zousie zong ahing kihil ta hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mangpa’n na sepman hing thuh henlen, Israelte Mangpa Pasian kihumbitna dinga ahalim nuoi na hing belin kipahman bukim hing peta hen,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu’n, “Na mitmu ah deisahna hing tangsahin, na suoh nungahte lah a khat hisih nanleng zong, nang na hing hamuon a, na suohnu hoitahin na hing houpita hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh ann neh hun in Boaz in akungah, “Hing pei inlen tanghoute hing ne inlen, tanghou themte uointhua lah ah hing die sam in,” achi hi. Tuachi’n amanu bu at mite kungah atou a; aman bu kan ana pie a, ane a, akham nua in zong aval nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh bu sang sui dinga adindoh in, Boaz in atangvalte kungah “Bu phai lah ate zong tom zel henlen, phawh sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh alom lah a butangte kesah unlen atom dingin nuasie zel unlen, phawh sih un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu’n lou ah nitahlam dongin busang a sui a, tualeh atomsate achil a, barlibu Ephah khat apha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu’n apuo a khuo ah apeita hi; tualeh a innpinu’n abu sang sui ana mu a, tuachi’n amanu’n akham zou a, aneh valte ahing ladoh a akungah pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh a innpinu’n a kungah, “Tuni’n heilang ah busang nava sui ei? heisungah nava sem ei? nang hing na thei nuompa guolzawl in umta hen,” achi hi. Tuachi’n amanu’n koi kunga nna vasem ahiei chi a innpinu ahila; “Tunia kava nasepna pa min Boaz ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Naomi in amounu kungah, “Mihing leh mishi tunga ahepina tawpsah ngailou Mangpa’n ama guolzawlta hen” achi hi. Tualeh Naomi in akungah “Tua mipa khu ikinaipi ahing zomtu i sanggampa i bul pi pa ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Moab numei Ruth in, “Aman zong ka kungah ka bu lahzou sieng masangsie uh ka tangvalte kungah na pan ngitnget ding ahi, ahing chi hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Naomi in Amounu Ruth kungah, “Hoi e ka tanu lou danga ahing mulouna dingun anungahte maimai toh zawhkhawm zel in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n barli bu leh bupi lah zou masangsie Boaz nungahte lah ngen ah bu sang suiin akuon akuon zela, tualeh api toh ateng khawm hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n a innpinu Naomi in akungah, “Nanga dinga hoi dingin inn suon thei na ding hing suipieh taleng hoilou ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh i sanggampa, asuoh nungahte toh ana nava sepnapa uh Boaz a um hilou amah? Ngaiin tuzan chienga bu phuol a barli bu zapsieng ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaziehin kisilsieng inlen, sathau kinu in, tualeh na puon sil inlen, phuol ah va peisuh in; hinanleh aneh a adawn zou masangsie kitheisah vawtsin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi dinga, alup chiengin alupna chiemte inlen, tuachi’n lut inlen, akeng lempieh inlen lum suhin; tuachi’n aman nabawl ding ahing hilding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu’n, “Ka kunga nagen bangin ka bawl ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n phuol ah apeisuh a, api’n ahil bang bangin abawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Boaz in ann ane a adawn zou in, tualeh alungsim a nuom asah mama bepin, bu vum bul a lum dingin apeita hi, tuachi’n amanu zong awl awl in ahing pei a, akeng alem a alumsuhta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi a, zankim lai in Boaz ahing khanglou a, ahing kihei leh akengbul ah numei khat ana lum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh ama’n “Koi na hiei?” a chi a, amanu’n na suohnu “Ruth ka hi, na puonsil na suohnu hing zawn in, ka sanggam kinaipi na hi,” chin adawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman, “Ka tanu Mangpa’n hing guolzawlta hen, tangval genthei ahiei, hausa ahiei, na zuilou dan in, achiil lai sangin atawp lam ah hoina na sulang zaw ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh ka tanu zausin, nagen bangbangin na tungah ka bawl ding hi, ka khuo a mi zousie’n numei kizen tah nahi chi ahing thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh, kei na sanggam kinaipi kahi chipen adih ahi, hinanleh kei sanga sanggam kinaipi a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuzan gieh inlen, zingmawng chiengin hichi ahi dinga aman na tungah sanggam kinaipi bawl ding lawm abawl nop leh ahoi ahi dinga; bawl mai heh; hinanleh sanggam kinaipi bawl ding lawm ahing bawlpieh nuomsih leh na tungah sanggam kinaipi bawl ding pen, Mangpa ahin bangin keiman ka bawl ngeingei ding hi, zingmawng dong lum tadi maiin,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu zingmawng dong akeng bul ah a lumta hi, “Tualeh koima kimu chien thei masang in athou a, tualeh amapan phuol ah numei ahing pei hi chi mawngmawng koiman theida heh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh aman akungah, “Na puonsil hing tawi inlen dawin achi a,” tualeh amanu’n adaw a, barli bu chin tena guh ate pieh a, aliengah apat a, tuachi’n amanu khuo ah apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh api kung ahing tunin, “Naomi in ka tanu bang na hing chiei?” ana chi hi, Tuachi’n amanu’n tua mipan atunga ana bawldan zousie ahilta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Ruth in, “Tam barli bu chin tena guh ahing pie a, napi kungah khut guohin pei sin ahing chi hi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Naomi in, “Ka tanu bangchibanga sil hing um ding ahiei chi nathei masang sien um khinkhian phot maiin, tunia tam sil abawl zou masangsie’n tua mipa asip nawn sih ding hi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n, Boaz kulpi kotkhah bul ah apeitou a, tua mun ah atou a; tualeh ngai vawi, Boaz in agenpa a sanggam kinaipi pen u’khu ahing pei a. Boaz in tua mipa kungah, “Lawm aw hing kihei inlen, tanah hing tou in,” achi a, tuachi’n akihei a, atouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Boaz in khum khopi a upate lah a mi sawm azawpi a, akung uah, “Tanah hing tou un” achia, tuachi’n atouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh a sanggam kinaipi penpa u’kungah, “Moab gam a kipata hing nua pei kia Naomi in isanggampa Elimelek gam azua a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n na kunga tana toute mitmu leh ka mite upate mitmu in leiin. Na tat nop leh tan inlen, hinanleh natat nuom sih leh hing hil in ka thei nuom hi. Aziehpen nanglou ngal atan ding dang a um sih hi, tualeh nang zom in kei ka hi chi hing theisah poimaw hiin ka thei hi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n aman “Ka tan ding hi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuchin Boaz in “Naomi khut akipat agam nalei ni niin, mi shipa zi Moab numei Ruth akipata mishi min manglou a, agouluo ding mi a um zel theina dinga mishipa zi meithai Moab numei Ruth zong anei alamteng toh nalei khawm ding ahi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh asanggam kinaipi penpa’n, “Keima dingin vang ka tan thei sih ding hi; khuchilouin pen keima gouneisate ka suthelthang kha ding hi, tan thei ka hina khu nangman tangmai in, tan zoulou ding ka hi zieh in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nidanglai a Israelte lah a sil bangkim a suhdetna ding ua, akitatdan u’leh akihentuo dan uh tambang ahi; mi khat in akedap asut a, a khatpa kungah apie u’hi; tua khu Israelte lah a abawldan uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaziehin asanggam kinaipipa un Boaz kungah “Nanga dingin lei zawmai in achi a; tuachi’n aman akedap asutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Boaz in upate leh mipi zousiete kungah, Naomi khut a kipat in Elimelek nei zousie leh Kilion leh Mahlon nei zousie ka leita hi chi, tuni’n atheipitute na uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua guoh hilouin, asanggamte lah a kipat leh tam khopi min gelna bu akipat mishi min amanlou na dingin leh gouluotu abawlpieh theina dingin Mahlon zi Moab numei Ruth zong ka zi dingin kaleita hi chi, tuni’n noute tuami theipitute nahi uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh kul kotpi a um mi zousie leh upaten, “Theipitute ka hi uh. Na innsunga numei hing lut khu Mangpa’n Israel innkuon dingsahtu nite, Rachel leh Leah bangin siemta hen, tualeh nang pen Ephrathah phung sungah suonhuoi tahin um inlen, Bethlehem ah minthang tahin hing umta in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n tam nungah akipat hahlesuon nang ahing pieh ding khu Tamar in Juda ahinpieh Perez innkuon bang hing hita hen,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Boaz in Ruth apui a, azi ahing hita hi; tuachi’n aluppi a, Mangpa’n nau apai sah a, tapa aneita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n numeiten Naomi kungah, “Tuni mama a Israelte lah a, amin manlouna dinga, sanggam kinaipi tasamlou a hing umsahpa Mangpa khu phat in umta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama khu na hinna tungdingpa leh na teh nua chienga hing vaa dingpa ahi ding hi; na mounu nangma hing it nu; tapa sagi sanga hoizawnu in ama ahingta hi, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Naomi in nausen khu ala a, a angsungah apom a, tuachi’n nauching nu ahing hita hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh a innveng numeiten amin aphuo pieh ua, “Naomi dingin tapa khat ahing pieng hi achi ua,” amin dingin Obed aphuota uhi. Ama David pu Jesai pa khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tamte Perez hahlesuonte ahi uhi. Perez in Hezron ahinga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hezron in Ram ahinga, Ram in Amminadab ahinga
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amminadab in Nahshon ahinga, Nahshon in Salmon ahinga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Salmon in Boaz ahinga, Boaz in Obed ahinga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Obed in Jesse ahinga, Jesse in David ahing hi.
  </para>
</usx>
